Hardening)\r\n\r\n### \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Bulletproof Startup Stability\r\n- Eliminated Main-Thread Jetpack Compose Multiplatform resource loader lockups on cold start and permission requests.\r\n- Secured WorkManager initialization and recurring background worker registration against race conditions and crash on OEM ROMs.\r\n- Hardened Koin dependency injection logger level to prevent string formatting crashes on Android launch.\r\n- Fully protected player cache initialization against DataStore disk read stalls.\r\n\r\n### \ud83d\udc65 Seamless & Rock-Solid \"Listen Together\"\r\n- Converted Listen Together bridge to lazy initialization, preventing premature Media3 ExoPlayer access before MediaService connects.\r\n- Guarded all ExoPlayer operations (play, pause, seek, crossfade suppression, playback position and duration reads) with Main-thread dispatching and non-blocking safety fallbacks.\r\n- Shielded WebSocket event loops and protocol frame decoders with active CoroutineExceptionHandler to guarantee zero crashes even during network drops, malformed packets, or server disconnects.\r\n- Added comprehensive error recovery when creating, joining, or leaving rooms.\r\n\r\n### \u26a1 60fps Butter-Smooth Performance\r\n- Retains hardware Canvas-rendered MiniLiveEqualizer and zero-overhead marquee search rows with instant single-tap song playback.\r\n- Ultra-fast native architecture update downloads (arm64-v8a) with 256KB I/O streaming buffers.\r\n"}